      "content": "it does feel a bit heavy, and the skin is kind of warm to the touch on that side. i don't have a fever or anything, so i guess it's probably okay? i really dont want to go back to the hospital and deal with the wait if i can just manage it at home with some ice and elevation. how long does it usually take for the swelling to go down?",
